    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Lap is a stylized Time Attack Racer with Roguelike style runs and upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.poster.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.webm?t=1748984633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.mp4?t=1748984633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GO FAST</strong> to complete your lap before time runs out to earn performance upgrades, added time, multipliers and other bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/upgrades.jpg?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from  unlockable cars and unique variants with different stats and handling characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade equipped effects how your car handles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/4c966fdb07494839732d3b0163cd64e8.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e416278ed79350e17e21d3acb0dc91d7.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive on a variety of tracks that each have their own challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different obstacles are added as you complete laps, making no two runs the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from &quot;Sponsors&quot; that effect how much time you have per lap, bonuses etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create synergies between different &quot;Sponsors&quot; and car upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes based mean that you'll find your right balance whether you're a beginner or hardcore player.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Lap is a stylized Time Attack Racer with Roguelike style runs and upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.poster.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.webm?t=1748984633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e9c4d1f6ae6cc4ca13bf7777bc49bcd3.mp4?t=1748984633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GO FAST</strong> to complete your lap before time runs out to earn performance upgrades, added time, multipliers and other bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/upgrades.jpg?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from  unlockable cars and unique variants with different stats and handling characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade equipped effects how your car handles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/4c966fdb07494839732d3b0163cd64e8.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550210/extras/e416278ed79350e17e21d3acb0dc91d7.avif?t=1748984633\" width=512 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive on a variety of tracks that each have their own challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different obstacles are added as you complete laps, making no two runs the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from &quot;Sponsors&quot; that effect how much time you have per lap, bonuses etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create synergies between different &quot;Sponsors&quot; and car upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes based mean that you'll find your right balance whether you're a beginner or hardcore player.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Time Attack Racer with Roguelike style runs and upgrades. Drive against the clock, gaining performance upgrades, time bonuses to unlock new cars and tracks. Get your car driving just the way you want it to try and make it... Another Lap!",
